# Languages and Translations

> Fuente: https://laravelmodules.com/docs/13/advanced/languages
> Exportado: 2026-07-23 (manual)

Stored in `Modules/{Module}/lang/`, namespace = module alias.

## Structure

```
Modules/Blog/lang/
├── en/messages.php
└── fr/messages.php
```

Published overrides: `resources/lang/modules/blog/` take priority.

## Usage

```php
__('blog::messages.welcome')
__('blog::posts.actions.create')
__('blog::messages.post_count', ['count' => $n])
trans_choice('blog::messages.posts', $count, ['count' => $count])
```

JSON files (`lang/fr.json`) use original string as key (no namespace).

## Commands

```bash
php artisan module:lang Blog
php artisan module:publish-translation Blog
```
